<Layout
  title="How to Choose a Workout Split — Complete Guide | SplitsWorkout"
  description="Not sure which workout split is right for you? This guide helps you choose the best split based on your schedule, goals, experience level, and equipment."
  canonical="/blog/how-to-choose-a-workout-split"
